      <title>Kennedy Center board votes to close it, as judge again keeps Trump's name off</title>
      <author>Anastasia Tsioulcas</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/09/15/nx-s1-5969905/kennedy-center-closing-trump-name</link>
